 ### [Partial Pre-Integration](1148-partial-pre-integration.md)
-A technique that improves ray integration approximation by using a 2D $\psi$ table independent of the transfer function. This allows interactive transfer function changes without recomputing the integration table, differing from standard discretization which recomputes weights per sample [1148-partial-pre-integration.md].
